<Paintings>
<Text 120 40 25 #233e5b 0 "16S NMC / BQ79616 VC-CB CIRCUIT - STATIC INSPECTION SHEET">
<Text 120 104 16 #233e5b 0 "Cell: LG INR21700-M50, 3.63 V nominal, 18.2 Wh; 16S1P assumed. R_cell + R_relax = 30 mOhm; split and relaxation time are unfitted assumptions.">
<Text 120 160 16 #233e5b 0 "Visible values; all electrical connections use wires. Junction dots connect; crossings without dots do not. Double-click to inspect a component.">
<Text 120 216 16 #233e5b 0 "CB loop: capacitor bank -> measured routed path -> assumed package L -> internal switch and assumed Cds -> adjacent pin -> capacitor bank.">
<Text 120 272 16 #233e5b 0 "All enable sources are static 0 V (OFF). Switch symbol is an electrical surrogate, not a fitted relay. 0/1 V control is abstract logic, not gate voltage.">
<Text 120 328 16 #233e5b 0 "ASSUMED: cell RC/L, package L, Cds, input returns and L/C per mm. TDK C/ESR/ESL/leakage and TI Ron limits have manufacturer references in wired-review.json.">
<Text 120 384 16 #233e5b 0 "Cap-bank landing stubs are collapsed. Main ADC internals and detailed harness mutual coupling are outside this sheet. No hardware wait is guaranteed.">
<Text 120 440 16 #233e5b 0 "One scripted study: repeated odd / OFF / even / OFF balancing. See circuit/README.md and report/README.md for assumptions and results.">
<Text 220 1056 18 #233e5b 0 "NMC CELL STACK">
